+<Page title="About Alex Kan | alexkan.xyz" description="About Alex Kan, his software projects, interests, and personal website alexkan.xyz.">
+    <h1>About Alex Kan</h1>
+    <p>I'm Alex Kan. This is my personal website, alexkan.xyz, where I share software projects and a few of my interests. On GitHub I publish code as <a href="https://github.com/akan72">akan72</a>. The site brings together links to that work, writing about my interests, and ways to find my public profiles.</p>
+    <p>My <a href="/projects">projects</a> include istheldown.com, a real-time map of NYC-area transit using official feeds, and mingus, a visualization of my music listening history since 2014. I also maintain dotfiles for tools such as Neovim and tmux. The code for this website is available in the <a href="https://github.com/akan72/xyz">xyz repository</a>: it uses Rust, WebAssembly, and Cloudflare Workers, with images stored in R2.</p>
+    <p>My interests include black metal, urbanism, Vim, and privacy; the <a href="/writing/gm">Writing</a> page has the full list. For questions about my work, corrections to a page, or professional conversations, see <a href="/contact">Contact</a>. This is a personal project collection, and the descriptions here should be read in that context.</p>
+    <nav aria-label="Site information"><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/about">About</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></nav>
+</Page>
+
+<style>
+    h1 { font-size: 1.5em; }
+    h2 { font-size: 1.25em; }
+</style>
